{
  "cdmVersionRange": ">=5.0.0",
  "_README": [
    "Renal impairment - the Kraiss sVQI-FS item (1 point): serum creatinine",
    "> 1.8 mg/dL OR dialysis. Concepts from",
    "covariates/covariate_concepts_vqifs.csv :: renal_impairment, whose",
    "concept_role column splits them into the creatinine and dialysis arms.",
    "",
    "THREE primary criteria, OR'd, mirroring what",
    "query_renal_impairment_covariate_counts() does: a Measurement threshold",
    "plus a dialysis arm that must span BOTH procedure_occurrence and",
    "condition_occurrence, because dialysis dependence is sometimes coded as a",
    "diagnosis rather than a procedure.",
    "",
    "DELIBERATELY NOT the [DVI] VA-FI Chronic kidney disease cohort (1797953).",
    "That is a CKD diagnosis proxy; this study's own history is the reason -",
    "pad-amp-nhd-val used a CKD diagnosis proxy until 2026-07-26 and it",
    "activated in 99.6% of a pilot cohort, because the descendants of 192359",
    "pull in acute and unspecified renal failure.",
    "PrimaryCriteriaLimit / QualifiedLimit / ExpressionLimit are all \"All\" and EndStrategy is StartDate+0, unlike the [DVI] VA-FI cohorts (1797948-1797977) which are \"First\". A first-ever-only cohort cannot answer a lookback-window question."
  ],
